OL,3,GNEWSAWedding fireworks cancelled over
OL,4,Awildfire fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey hotel's fireworks display has
OL,7,Fbeen cancelled after residents in the
OL,8,Farea voiced concerns it might spark
OL,9,Fwildfires in neighbouring woodland.
OL,11,FPennyhill Park Hotel & Spa in Bagshot
OL,12,Fhad told locals it would be holding "a
OL,13,Fprofessionally managed, approximately
OL,14,Ffive minute display" at 22:00 BST on
OL,15,FSaturday as part of a wedding
OL,16,Fcelebration at the venue.
OL,18,FIt stated that a "detailed risk
OL,19,Fassessment" had been undertaken and
OL,20,F"additional precautionary measures
OL,21,Fintroduced", including "two private
OL,22,Ffire engines and a crew" on site .
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
