OL,3,GNEWSAWedding fireworks cancelled over
OL,4,Awildfire fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, some feared stray embers could
OL,7,Fcause "massive destruction" to the
OL,8,Fadjacent Swinley Forest, prompting the
OL,9,Fevent's cancellation.
